# The three edges at a corner of the extrusion of path_extrude picked
# with the mouse on the turned view and chamfered, then given a second
# distance of 2 on the chamfer's screen: a corner of chamfers of two
# distances, which the strips' cuts and a patch fill. The same as
# path_chamfer_corner.go makes (TestPathEquivalence/chamfer_corner).
key r
move 200 200
down L 200 200
up L 200 200
move 380 330
down L 380 330
up L 380 330
key esc
key x shift
# Its depth held and typed as 80 on its screen: the model was drawn
# for a deep part, deeper than a new extrusion of this sketch starts.
twmove 501 125
twdown L 501 125
twup L 501 125
twmove 501 125
twdown L 501 125
twup L 501 125
edit 80
view rotated
menu View|Zoom To Fit
move 499.8 84.6
down L 499.8 84.6
up L 499.8 84.6
move 359.1 56
down L 359.1 56
up L 359.1 56
move 402.2 219.4
down L 402.2 219.4
up L 402.2 219.4
menu Features|Chamfer Edges
twmove 263 145
twdown L 263 145
twup L 263 145
edit 2
